<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:50:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>股市上涨削弱避险需求，国债回落</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens</link><description>随着感恩节假期后市场重新开放，美国国债交投清淡，亚洲股市上涨抑制了对避险资产的需求。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens'&gt;股市上涨削弱避险需求，国债回落&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Treasuries Retreat as Gains in Equities Sap Demand for Havens&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:43:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>日本“东京漂移”汽车文化吸引全球车迷</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/japan-s-tokyo-drift-car-culture-draws-global-fans-video</link><description>日本最新的愿望清单景点：《速度与激情》系列电影的世界。日本的汽车界吸引了来自世界各地的车迷，游客纷纷涌入，一睹因电影而永垂不朽的稀有丰田和日产车型。斯特凡·尼古拉还有更多。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/japan-s-tokyo-drift-car-culture-draws-global-fans-video'&gt;日本“东京漂移”汽车文化吸引全球车迷&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Japan’s ‘Tokyo Drift’ Car Culture Draws Global Fans&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/japan-s-tokyo-drift-car-culture-draws-global-fans-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:18:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>风险偏好回归，铜价自 11 个月低点反弹</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/copper-rebounds-from-11-month-low-on-return-of-risk-appetite</link><description>铜价与亚洲科技股一起从 11 个月低点反弹，因人工智能交易担忧引发的数周波动后，市场风险偏好有所回升。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/copper-rebounds-from-11-month-low-on-return-of-risk-appetite'&gt;风险偏好回归，铜价自 11 个月低点反弹&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Copper Rebounds From 11-Month Low on Return of Risk Appetite&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/copper-rebounds-from-11-month-low-on-return-of-risk-appetite</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:33:07 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着市场重新站稳脚跟，亚洲新兴市场股市将每周上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing</link><description>随着投资者重返科技股以及人工智能行业情绪改善，亚洲新兴市场股市预计每周上涨，收复了近期的部分抛售。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing'&gt;随着市场重新站稳脚跟，亚洲新兴市场股市将每周上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：EM Asia Stocks Set for Weekly Gain as Markets Regain Footing&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:33:48 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>是什么推动香港房屋租金创新高</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/what-s-driving-hong-kong-home-rents-to-new-highs-video</link><description>Habitat Property创始人兼首席执行官维多利亚·艾伦(Victoria Allan)向彭博电视台表示，随着外籍人士回国、银行招聘增加以及更多来自中国大陆的移民收紧住房供应，竞争性报价正在推高香港租金。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/what-s-driving-hong-kong-home-rents-to-new-highs-video'&gt;是什么推动香港房屋租金创新高&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：What’s Driving Hong Kong Home Rents to New Highs&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/what-s-driving-hong-kong-home-rents-to-new-highs-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:41:24 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>